Task 1: Set up Kubernetes Readiness and Liveness Probes
Subtask 1.1: Create a Sample Application with Health Endpoints
First, we'll deploy a sample application that includes health check endpoints.

Create a new project namespace for our lab:
oc new-project health-probe-lab
Create a sample application with health endpoints. Save the following as sample-app.yaml:
apiVersion: apps/v1
kind: Deployment
metadata:
  name: health-demo-app
  namespace: health-probe-lab
  labels:
    app: health-demo
    version: v1
spec:
  replicas: 2
  selector:
    matchLabels:
      app: health-demo
      version: v1
  template:
    metadata:
      labels:
        app: health-demo
        version: v1
    spec:
      containers:
      - name: health-demo
        image: quay.io/redhattraining/health-probe-demo:latest
        ports:
        - containerPort: 8080
        env:
