Subtask 2.2: Configure Istio Sidecar Injection
Enable automatic sidecar injection for the namespace:
oc label namespace health-probe-lab istio-injection=enabled
Restart the deployment to inject sidecars:
oc rollout restart deployment/health-demo-app -n health-probe-lab
