Troubleshooting Common Issues
Issue 1: Probes Failing Due to Slow Application Startup
Symptoms: Pods continuously restart during startup

Solution:

# Increase initialDelaySeconds and use startup probes
# Update deployment with longer delays
oc patch deployment health-demo-app -n health-probe-lab -p '{"spec":{"template":{"spec":{"containers":[{"name":"health-demo","livenessProbe":{"initialDelaySeconds":30}}]}}}}'
Issue 2: Service Mesh Sidecar Interfering with Health Checks
Symptoms: Health checks work without service mesh but fail with sidecars

Solution:

# Check if probes are hitting the sidecar instead of the application
oc logs -n health-probe-lab -l app=health-demo -c istio-proxy

# Ensure probes target the correct port
oc describe pod -l app=health-demo -n health-probe-lab
Issue 3: Readiness Probe Not Removing Pod from Endpoints
Symptoms: Failed readiness probes don't remove pod from service

Solution:

# Check service selector matches pod labels
oc get service health-demo-service -n health-probe-lab -o yaml
oc get pods -l app=health-demo -n health-probe-lab --show-labels

# Verify endpoint controller is working
oc get events -n health-probe-lab | grep endpoints
